@* AD-14 — System.Net.Http is deliberately absent here. HTTP lives in Core/ and Features/*/Data/,
   and those files write their own usings, so no component picks one up by ambient import.
   The generated client's namespace is absent for the same reason: the client and its DTOs stop at
   the seam, and WebStructureTests fails the build if a component reaches one. *@
